{"book":"I Samuel","chapter":16,"entries":[{"id":7596,"title":"I Samuel 16:1","segments":["¶And the LORD said unto Samuel, How long wilt thou mourn for Saul, seeing I have rejected him from reigning over Israel? fill thine horn with oil, and go, I will send thee to Jesse the Bethlehemite: for I have provided me a king among his sons."],"ref":"I Samuel 16:1","verse":1,"words":[{"text":"¶And the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto Samuel","strong":"H8050"},{"text":", How long wilt thou mourn","strong":"H56"},{"text":" for Saul","strong":"H7586"},{"text":", seeing I have rejected","strong":"H3988"},{"text":" him from reigning","strong":"H4427"},{"text":" over Israel","strong":"H3478"},{"text":"? fill","strong":"H4390"},{"text":" thine horn","strong":"H7161"},{"text":" with oil","strong":"H8081"},{"text":", and go","strong":"H3212"},{"text":", I will send","strong":"H7971"},{"text":" thee to Jesse","strong":"H3448"},{"text":" the Bethlehemite","strong":"H1022"},{"text":": for I have provided","strong":"H7200"},{"text":" me a king","strong":"H4428"},{"text":" among his sons","strong":"H1121"},{"text":"."}]},{"id":7597,"title":"I Samuel 16:2","segments":["And Samuel said, How can I go? if Saul hear [it], he will kill me. And the LORD said, Take an heifer with thee, and say, I am come to sacrifice to the LORD. {with thee: Heb. in thine hand}"],"ref":"I Samuel 16:2","verse":2,"words":[{"text":"And Samuel","strong":"H8050"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", How can I go","strong":"H3212"},{"text":"? if Saul","strong":"H7586"},{"text":" hear","strong":"H8085"},{"text":" [it], he will kill","strong":"H2026"},{"text":" me. And the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Take","strong":"H3947"},{"text":" an heifer","strong":"H1241"},{"text":"","strong":"H5697"},{"text":" with thee","strong":"H3027"},{"text":", and say","strong":"H559"},{"text":", I am come","strong":"H935"},{"text":" to sacrifice","strong":"H2076"},{"text":" to the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":". {with thee: Heb. in thine hand}"}]},{"id":7598,"title":"I Samuel 16:3","segments":["And call Jesse to the sacrifice, and I will shew thee what thou shalt do: and thou shalt anoint unto me [him] whom I name unto thee."],"ref":"I Samuel 16:3","verse":3,"words":[{"text":"And call","strong":"H7121"},{"text":" Jesse","strong":"H3448"},{"text":" to the sacrifice","strong":"H2077"},{"text":", and I will shew","strong":"H3045"},{"text":" thee what thou shalt do","strong":"H6213"},{"text":": and thou shalt anoint","strong":"H4886"},{"text":" unto me [him] whom I name","strong":"H559"},{"text":" unto thee."}]},{"id":7599,"title":"I Samuel 16:4","segments":["And Samuel did that which the LORD spake, and came to Bethlehem. And the elders of the town trembled at his coming, and said, Comest thou peaceably? {coming: Heb. meeting}"],"ref":"I Samuel 16:4","verse":4,"words":[{"text":"And Samuel","strong":"H8050"},{"text":" did","strong":"H6213"},{"text":" that which the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":" spake","strong":"H1696"},{"text":", and came","strong":"H935"},{"text":" to Bethlehem","strong":"H1035"},{"text":". And the elders","strong":"H2205"},{"text":" of the town","strong":"H5892"},{"text":" trembled","strong":"H2729"},{"text":" at his coming","strong":"H7125"},{"text":", and said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Comest","strong":"H935"},{"text":" thou peaceably","strong":"H7965"},{"text":"? {coming: Heb. meeting}"}]},{"id":7600,"title":"I Samuel 16:5","segments":["And he said, Peaceably: I am come to sacrifice unto the LORD: sanctify yourselves, and come with me to the sacrifice. And he sanctified Jesse and his sons, and called them to the sacrifice."],"ref":"I Samuel 16:5","verse":5,"words":[{"text":"And he said","strong":"H559"},{"text":", Peaceably","strong":"H7965"},{"text":": I am come","strong":"H935"},{"text":" to sacrifice","strong":"H2076"},{"text":" unto the LORD","strong":"H3068"},{"text":": sanctify","st